  description: 'If you activate a "Fire Formation" Spell/Trap Card (except during
    the Damage Step): You can Special Summon this card from your hand, then you can
    Special Summon 1 "Fire Fist" monster from your GY, except "Brotherhood of the
    Fire Fist - Panda", also you cannot Special Summon monsters for the rest of this
    turn, except "Fire Fist" monsters. If a "Fire Fist" monster(s) you control would
    be destroyed by your opponent''s card effect, you can send 1 face-up "Fire Formation"
    Spell/Trap you control to the GY instead. You can only use each effect of "Brotherhood
    of the Fire Fist - Panda" once per turn.'
